    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to offer Apt 103 The Watermill to the sales market. A 2 bedroomed ground floor apartment with balcony situated in an enviable location, strolling distance to St. Annes Park, the Coastal promenade walkway/cycle track is on your doorstep not to mention easy access to Dollymount Beach and a host of sports clubs. This well maintained apartment offers generous living space, 2 double bedrooms, master ensuite and accommodation extending to \nc. 65sq.m. The property is sure to be a popular choice for those seeking to buy their first home or for downsizers looking to stay in the locality. Viewing strongly recommended.\n\nLocated within walking distance are an abundance of excellent amenities including supermarkets, bakery, restaurants, coffee shops, library and banks. Raheny Village and DART station are easily accessible together with a choice of bus routes including the H bus route to the city centre, St. Anne`s Park and the stunning Coastal Walkway/Cycle Track and Dollymount Beach. The property is only a short distance from East Point Business Park, Dublin City Centre and 25 minutes drive to Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall\nStorage closet. Hotpress. Laminate flooring.\n\nLounge/Diningroom - 7.8m (25'7\") x 3.28m (10'9\")\nSemi solid flooring. Door to private balcony.\n\nKitchen - 2.34m (7'8\") x 2.24m (7'4\")\nRange of maple shaker fitted press units. Granite worktop. Plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Tiled floor. Integrated appliances included in the sale.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.16m (16'11\") x 2.69m (8'10\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Ensuite shower (tiled), screen, whb and wc. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.74m (9'0\") x 2.51m (8'3\")\nBuilt in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom\nBath, screen, whb, wc and shower attachment. Partially tiled walls. Tiled floor."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Double Glazed Windows </li><li> Gas Central Heating </li><li> Balcony </li><li> Ensuite </li><li> Designated Underground Parking (No. 171) </li><li> Located Opposite St. Annes Park </li><li> Secure Well Maintained Communal Grounds </li><li> Communal Bins</li></ul>"
      },
